{
  "_comment": "Host only: MaPLe (n_ctx=2, depth 9) on frozen CLIP. MaPLe's own recipe is SGD lr 0.0035, bs 4, 5 epochs; bs/epochs enlarged for the MRI set (12 GB GPU).",
